Package: libclamaudioio0-dev
Version: 0.8-1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.3.2), libstdc++5 (>= 1:3.3.5), libgcc1 (>= 1:4.0), libsndfile1 (>= 1.0.10), libogg0 (>= 1.1.2), libvorbisenc2 (>= 1.0.1), libvorbis0a (>= 1.0.1), libvorbisfile3 (>= 1.0.1), libmad0 (>= 0.15), libid3-3.8.3 (>= 3.8.3), libasound2 (>= 1.0.8), libclamcore0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamprocessing0-dev(>= 0.8) 
Maintainer: CLAM development team <clam@iua.upf.es>
Description: clam framework audio and MIDI i/o components
 libclamaudioio0-dev bundles together all the CLAM
 framework components that allow to:
   * Read or write data from/into a sound card buffer
   * Read or write data from/into audio files (both
     PCM and compressed - Vorbis and Mpeg)
   * Read or write messages from MIDI devices
   * Read or write messages from MIDI files
